.TH std::copyable_function::swap 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::copyable_function::swap \- std::copyable_function::swap

.SH Synopsis
void swap( copyable_function& other ) noexcept;  (since C++26)

Exchanges the stored callable objects of *this and other.

.SH Parameters

other - function wrapper to exchange the stored callable object with

.SH Return value

\fI(none)\fP

.SH See also

swap swaps the contents
     \fI(public member function of std::function<R(Args...)>)\fP
swap swaps the targets of two std::move_only_function objects
     \fI(public member function of std::move_only_function)\fP
